{
  "//": [
    "Jest-only tsconfig.",
    "",
    "`tsconfig.json` maps `@goalxi/database` / `@goalxi/logger` to their",
    "COMPILED `dist/` output, which is correct for `nest build`. ts-jest,",
    "however, type-checks through this file, so specs were type-resolved",
    "against `dist/` too. That produced two failure modes:",
    "",
    "  - on a fresh clone `libs/*/dist` does not exist, so every suite",
    "    importing a shared entity failed with",
    "    `TS2307: Cannot find module '@goalxi/database'`;",
    "  - with a STALE `dist/`, specs silently type-checked and tested the",
    "    previous version of every shared domain formula.",
    "",
    "Pointing the spec tsconfig at `src/` makes tests read the source of",
    "truth, so no pre-test build step is needed and a stale build can never",
    "quietly invalidate a green suite. `jest.config.json`'s",
    "`moduleNameMapper` mirrors these paths for runtime resolution — both",
    "halves are required: the mapper fixes `require`, this fixes types."
  ],
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "paths": {
      "@/api/*": [
        "src/api/*"
      ],
      "@/background/*": [
        "src/background/*"
      ],
      "@/common/*": [
        "src/common/*"
      ],
      "@/config/*": [
        "src/config/*"
      ],
      "@/constants/*": [
        "src/constants/*"
      ],
      "@/database/*": [
        "src/database/*"
      ],
      "@/decorators/*": [
        "src/decorators/*"
      ],
      "@/exceptions/*": [
        "src/exceptions/*"
      ],
      "@/filters/*": [
        "src/filters/*"
      ],
      "@/generated/*": [
        "src/generated/*"
      ],
      "@/guards/*": [
        "src/guards/*"
      ],
      "@/health/*": [
        "src/health/*"
      ],
      "@/interceptors/*": [
        "src/interceptors/*"
      ],
      "@/libs/*": [
        "src/libs/*"
      ],
      "@/mail/*": [
        "src/mail/*"
      ],
      "@/redis/*": [
        "src/redis/*"
      ],
      "@/shared/*": [
        "src/shared/*"
      ],
      "@/utils/*": [
        "src/utils/*"
      ],
      "@goalxi/database": [
        "../libs/database/src"
      ],
      "@goalxi/logger": [
        "../libs/logger/src"
      ],
      "@goalxi/database/*": [
        "../libs/database/src/*"
      ],
      "@goalxi/logger/*": [
        "../libs/logger/src/*"
      ]
    }
  },
  "include": [
    "src/**/*.ts",
    "test/**/*.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "node_modules",
    "dist"
  ]
}
